{"verse_key": "10:30", "surah": 10, "verse": 30, "text_uthmani": "هُنَالِكَ تَبْلُوا۟ كُلُّ نَفْسٍ مَّآ أَسْلَفَتْ ۚ وَرُدُّوٓا۟ إِلَى ٱللَّهِ مَوْلَىٰهُمُ ٱلْحَقِّ ۖ وَضَلَّ عَنْهُم مَّا كَانُوا۟ يَفْتَرُونَ", "translation": "There, [on that Day], every soul will be put to trial for what it did previously, and they will be returned to Allāh, their master, the Truth, and lost from them is whatever they used to invent.", "verse_from_ms": 784350, "verse_to_ms": 806010, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "هُنَالِكَ", "start_ms": 784350, "end_ms": 785640}, {"i": 1, "text": "تَبْلُوا۟", "start_ms": 785640, "end_ms": 786440}, {"i": 2, "text": "كُلُّ", "start_ms": 786440, "end_ms": 787020}, {"i": 3, "text": "نَفْسٍ", "start_ms": 787020, "end_ms": 787660}, {"i": 4, "text": "مَّآ", "start_ms": 787660, "end_ms": 790529}, {"i": 5, "text": "أَسْلَفَتْ", "start_ms": 790530, "end_ms": 791670}, {"i": 6, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 791670, "end_ms": 796220}, {"i": 7, "text": "وَرُدُّوٓا۟", "start_ms": 796220, "end_ms": 796760}, {"i": 8, "text": "إِلَى", "start_ms": 796760, "end_ms": 797410}, {"i": 9, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 797410, "end_ms": 798520}, {"i": 10, "text": "مَوْلَىٰهُمُ", "start_ms": 798520, "end_ms": 799440}, {"i": 11, "text": "ٱلْحَقِّ", "start_ms": 799440, "end_ms": 800160}, {"i": 12, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 800160, "end_ms": 801070}, {"i": 13, "text": "وَضَلَّ", "start_ms": 801070, "end_ms": 801810}, {"i": 14, "text": "عَنْهُم", "start_ms": 801810, "end_ms": 802540}, {"i": 15, "text": "مَّا", "start_ms": 802540, "end_ms": 805615}, {"i": 16, "text": "كَانُوا۟", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 17, "text": "يَفْتَرُونَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}